                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#1v">-1v</locus>وَمَآ أُبَرِّئُ نَفْسِ اِنِّ النَّفْسَ لَأَمَّارَةُ بِالسُّوْءِ اِلَّا مَا رَحِمَ رَبِّيَ اِنَّ رَبِّيْ غَفُوْرٌ رَّحِيْمٌ</incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#14v">-14v</locus>هَذَا بَلَاغٌ لِلْنَّاسِ وَلِيُنْذَرُوْا بِهِ وَلِيَعْلَمُوْا أَنِّمَا هُوَ إلَهٌ وَاحِدٌ ولِيَذَكِّرَ اُوْلُوْا الأَلبَابِ</explicit>
                     <note>12:53-14:52. Red triple dots or red commas as verse markers. Curve of final nūn-s, and fā'-s in a shape of a more than 90° angle with a thick stroke. Vocalization in lighter black ink. Rubricated titles of sūras. Some letters or sentences enhanced using red ink. Ihmāl marks (rā’-s, sīn-s). Some extensions of letters and words into the margin. Several words left uncompleted at the end of a line, without diacritics or vocalization, and written in full on the following line. Some words completed on the following line. Irregular catchwords.</note>
                     <note/>
